    "description": "Welcome to this stunning two-flat duplex house, boasting a handsome Craftsman facade that exudes timeless charm and elegance. Nestled on a flat, tree-lined street, this property offers a perfect blend of classic design and modern comfort. Step outside and be captivated by the lush, professionally landscaped front and back gardens. The outdoor spaces provide a serene retreat, ideal for relaxation or entertaining. Both the front and back yards are meticulously maintained, offering a picturesque setting that enhances the home's curb appeal. Each unit features a spacious and inviting layout, offering three generous bedrooms and two full bathrooms. These updated units are move-in ready, ensuring a seamless transition for new owners. The interiors have been thoughtfully designed with a focus on both functionality and style, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere throughout. This adorable duplex is a rare find, combining the allure of a Craftsman home with the practicality of modern updates and a convenient location. Whether you're looking for an investment property or a multi-generational living solution, this duplex is sure to impress. Don't miss the opportunity to make this charming property your new home!"
